set version_date    2025-01-13T15:22:22Z
github.setup        LuaJIT LuaJIT a4f56a459a588ae768801074b46ba0adcfb49eb1
revision            2
checksums           rmd160  a01e4fb5337b3dbb1e5eb544fc43dd8cfda9c610 \
